What this does:

- As before we try to pull the DI-container (`parentDi || di.$parent`).
- We now first check (`if (!container || typeof container.get !== 'function')`) and bail out if it doesn’t exist.
- This prevents the uncaught TypeError when there is no parent DI to walk up to.
